+# ADK 11.2.18: reader-first and feedback-based Skill method quality
+
+- Reference six independently inspected source files, each with exact file blob and method-only decision.
+- Improve existing ADR and handoff authoring: an unfamiliar reader should identify status, decision, relevant evidence, next action and recovery without hidden chat context.
+- Keep lite authoring cheap; a self-check must not impersonate actual independent reader or receiver signoff.
+- Improve existing Skill lifecycle: confirmed failure feedback should yield the smallest appropriate regression case; static tests must not imply E2–E4 model performance.
